  "notes": "Cash-basis village. Governmental data from Statement of Receipts, Disbursements and Changes in Fund Balances (Total column, p4); General, Street, Keno are governmental. Water, Sewer, Sanitation are business-type (p6 total column). Interest income, bond principal/interest printed below the Total Receipts/Disbursements on p4 and the 'Other receipts (disbursements)' block on p6 are recorded as normal items with outside_printed_total. Business-type: the line items roll forward exactly (770,085 + 487,905 - 584,657 = 673,333); the printed p6 TOTAL RECEIPTS 429,249 is $1 above its lines (429,248), recorded in report_discrepancies. Cash flow statement (pp7-8) shows beginning 770,084 vs 770,085 on p6; p6 used. Balance sheet (user rule 2026-10-27): governmental lines come from the Statement of Assets and Fund Balances - Cash Basis - Governmental Funds (p3, Total column: cash -25,218, cash with County Treasurer 5,801; fund balances Restricted -116,873, Unassigned 97,456), whose total (-19,417) equals the government-wide governmental column on p1; business-type lines from the p1 Proprietary column; totals from the p1 Total column (net position 653,916). The printed net position lines on p1 add to 653,915, $1 below the printed total (report_discrepancies). Governmental cash is negative (Street fund -116,873). General Fund statement on p9 shows the combined governmental totals (278,824 / 241,635) despite its title, so it is a duplicate and not recorded in detail. Personnel services 114,714 on p4 is split by its printed General 71,354 / Street 43,360 columns. Charges for services 21,920 on p4 is the franchise fee (p10 'Franchise Fees', p2 'Electric, gas, and cable lease'), so it is recorded as occupation/franchise tax. Business-type 'Charge for services' is Utility Charges (user 2026-10-28). Zero line Keno omitted. Detail (user 2026-10-27): per-fund lines from the fund statements' columns (p4, p6) replace the combined all-funds budget schedule (p10); the earlier decision_needed questions about the p10 'Taxes'/'Interest' lines were removed because those lines are no longer recorded. Attempt 3 (2026-10-28): verifier fixes (equity discrepancy recorded, receipts discrepancy corrected, utility charges category, stale decision_needed removed). Read pages 1-10 of 10"
